  "text": "<spk:0> Oh, can you believe we actually did it? We made it through the storm wind howling, rain lashing I thought we'd never see the sun again. There were nights nights I cried myself to sleep, whispering, is anyone even out there? But then you showed up. You smiled, and suddenly the world wasn't so dark. I felt seen, understood. Then builds remember that silly dance in the kitchen with burnt pancakes? Oh, we were a mess. But now now you've gone. The silence is deafening. I miss you every single day, but I carry you with me in every laugh, every tear, every quiet moment. And I'll keep going because that's what you'd want always.",
